Usage: ruralz completion SHELL [FLAGS]

Print a shell completion script.

Install:
  bash        source <(ruralz completion bash)
  zsh         ruralz completion zsh > "${fpath[1]}/_ruralz"
  fish        ruralz completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/ruralz.fish
  powershell  ruralz completion powershell | Out-String | Invoke-Expression

Arguments:
  SHELL  Shell to complete for (bash, zsh, fish or powershell)

Flags:
  --help  Print this help
